            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The issue is whether Section 14501 of the United States Transportation Code expressly preempts the respondent\u2019s state law consumer\u2011protection tort claims for damages against a tow\u2011truck company that towed the vehicle lawfully and later disposed of it after the towing and storage fees were unpaid."
      }
    ],
